    "stderr": "error: Rule `github-actions-action-input-policy` has invalid value \"${{ matrix.widget }}\" for `options.actions[].uses`. Expected a concrete action family.\nRule `github-actions-action-input-policy` has invalid value \"format\" for `options.actions[].require`. Expected an input key in allowedInputs [\"name\"] for action `example/publish-widget`.\nRule `github-actions-action-input-policy` has invalid value \"name\" for `options.actions[].ban`. Expected an input key outside allowedInputs [\"name\"] for action `example/publish-widget`.\nRule `github-actions-cache-key-policy` has invalid value \"   \" for `options.forbiddenPathsMessage`. Expected a non-empty message.\nRule `github-actions-cache-key-policy` has invalid value \"\" for `options.caches[].lockfile`. Expected a non-empty path.\nRule `github-actions-cache-key-policy` has invalid value \".cache/widgets\" for `options.forbiddenPaths`. Expected a path absent from options.caches[].path.\nRule `github-actions-cache-key-policy` has invalid value \"os\" for `options.caches[].keyParts`. Expected a dotted context fragment such as runner.os.\nRule `vitest-default-excludes` has invalid value \"   \" for `options.config`. Expected an explicit non-empty Vitest config file path.\nRule `vitest-default-excludes` has invalid value \"\" for `options.files`. Expected a valid non-empty glob.\nRule `vitest-default-excludes` has invalid value \"\" for `options.requiredGlobs`. Expected a non-empty glob string.\nRule `vitest-default-excludes` has invalid value \"[unclosed\" for `options.files`. Expected a valid non-empty glob (invalid glob: error parsing glob '[unclosed': unclosed character class; missing ']').\n"
